      "content": "PICCOTT'S END 1. 5252                                                   (East Side)                                                   No 140 TL 0509 8/209 II                       GV 2. Mid C19 front and south side elevation.  Earlier timber frame exposed on north side elevation.  Red brick dressings to yellow brickwork, hipped Welsh slated roof with bracketed cornice.  2 storeys, 2 sash windows with glazing bars in reveals.  Included for group value. Nos 140 to 150 (even) form a group. Listing NGR: TL0509409131"
    }
